# Blade and Tailwind UI

- Prefer shared Blade layouts, partials, and small reusable sections over full-page duplicated HTML.
- Use Tailwind utilities and shared CSS tokens in `resources/css/app.css` before adding new inline `<style>` blocks.
- Keep the visual style modern, fluid, and minimal, with strong spacing and clear CTA hierarchy.
- For auth and dashboard screens, favor accessible headings, concise copy, and obvious primary actions.
- When a page needs dynamic theming, read from CSS variables instead of hardcoded per-view colors.
